### hilavitkutin-sym

Generic interned-identity core for the hilavitkutin ecosystem. `no_std`,
no alloc, no ecosystem dependencies. Provides `Sym`, a 4-byte
integer-equality handle tagged by a 4-bit domain `kind`, the `Domain`
trait ladder that distinguishes deduplicated-value domains from
minted-fresh domains, the `Interner` producer trait, and the `Generator`
mint-only producer. String interning is one domain of this core, supplied
by `hilavitkutin-str`.
